und Stimmungsschwankungen. Es ist eine ganzheitliche Lösung für das Wohlbefinden während der Menstruation.“</span></p></span></div></div></div></div><div data-state="inactive" data-orientation="vertical" role="tabpanel" aria-labelledby="radix-:R6ar2:-trigger-5285ded1-309e-4acb-b099-af88c34556fe2" id="radix-:R6ar2:-content-5285ded1-309e-4acb-b099-af88c34556fe2" tabindex="0" style="display:none"><div data-rid="b52e0126-b336-426b-90bb-13a47c656231" class="r-19tsb4o"><picture data-rid="64b7501e-c37a-4983-9526-09cf82348de8" class="r-1tt2ptb"><source srcSet="https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0708/7462/8371/files/3_4_46c29972-1323-4ad7-97db-14cd49c989aa.webp?v=1737642708&amp;width=820" media="(max-width: 640px)"/><source srcSet="https://andytown-public.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/templates/component-templates/AG%20Lp/bc3d69b3-dffe-436b-badc-9223d9d0ae8a_huberman.jpg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%2Cformat" media="(min-width: 641px) and (max-width: 1024px)"/><source srcSet="https://andytown-public.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/templates/component-templates/AG%20Lp/bc3d69b3-dffe-436b-badc-9223d9d0ae8a_huberman.jpg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%2Cformat" media="(min-width: 1025px) and (max-width: 2400px)"/><img src="https://andytown-public.s3.us-west-1.amazonaws.com/templates/component-templates/AG%20Lp/bc3d69b3-dffe-436b-badc-9223d9d0ae8a_huberman.jpg%3Fauto%3Dcompress%2Cformat" alt="A person smiling in a setting with vertical blinds and a plant in the background." class="r-em99fg" loading="lazy"/></picture><div data-rid="ccc778dc-effa-43f4-98e1-0a21c5c839fd" class="r-1iptyo3"><div data-rid="e25ffffc-ba97-40c2-9050-399d788965fa" class="r-i8n5ro alchemy-rte" style="--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-color:#252a31;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attributes-fontsize:22px;--replo-library-7229a9be-0ff2-4194-85c2-a9c88cbfa244-styles-ece01f1d-0e12-429a-8e5e-958d2509494b-attr